    {
      "source": "All custom instances are later processed by Boot and Spring MVC configurations. To\nparticipate in, and if desired, override that subsequent processing,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/config/annotation/WebMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurer</code></a> should be used.",
      "translation": "所有自定义实例随后都会由 Boot 和 Spring MVC 配置进行处理。若要参与该后续处理，并且（如需要）覆盖它，则应使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/config/annotation/WebMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A single instance of this component should be registered, otherwise making it\nimpossible to choose from redundant MVC components.",
      "translation": "应注册此组件的单个实例，否则将无法从冗余的 MVC 组件中进行选择。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/mvc/method/annotation/ExceptionHandlerExceptionResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>ExceptionHandlerExceptionResolver</code></a> that should be used and\nprocessed by the MVC configuration.",
